    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are delighted to present this beautifully refurbished ground floor apartment to the open market. Ideally positioned in the very heart of Dublin 7, this attractive flat offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, together with ample on-street parking available in the surrounding area and the beautiful Blessington Basin Park within just a stone's throw of the property. The flat retains many of its original features and is presented in true turnkey condition throughout, offering an excellent opportunity for a tenant to move into a warm & comfortable home that is available immediately.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and spacious entrance hall, leading to a generously sized bathroom fitted with an electric shower and wash hand basin. The main living area features a fully equipped kitchen, together with a dining table and chairs. A single bed is positioned adjacent to the attractive Georgian window, which overlooks the spacious south-facing communal courtyardis access to a communal laundry area, with washing facilities provided free of charge for residents. Bin collection is also included at no additional cost.\r\n\r\nThe location of 47 Blessington Street could not be better. Located North West of Dublin city centre, local amenities and focal points include the Four Courts, Old Jameson Distillery, which shows how the famous whiskey is made, the Bridge Art gallery, Mill Race gallery and Collins Barracks which is home to the National Museum of Ireland. With excellent public transport services such as the Luas and Dublin Bus you'll be in easy reach of wherever you need to be. Furthermore, the apartment also offers ample on-street parking. From the apartment up the street you'll expecting a very nice feature the Blessington Street Basin park, which is known as Dublin's secret garden, as it remains largely undiscovered in the city. Most of the park is water and it also includes an artificial island created as a refuge for animals.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer, and is strictly by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844690."
